<title>FRANCE: Schneider H1 sales rise to 22.7 bln ffr.</title>
<headline>Schneider H1 sales rise to 22.7 bln ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					22,746    vs   20,915</p>
<p>NOTE: Schneider gave the figures in a statement. It said that the sale of Spie Batignolles and other assets substantially changed the group's structure, as a result sales figures for the first half of 1996 were restated to exclude these businesses.</p>
<p>Sales rose 8.8 percent between the two periods. Sales rose 3.4 percent at comparable exchange rates.</p>
<p>The group confirmed its target of a five percent rise in sales (excluding currency impact) for full year 1997 following a strong rise in second quarter sales.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
